      "index": "ae",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "1. Raw analyst report (NOT stored)\n\n\"Churn rose from 31% to 38% in March.\nNike lost 1,240 repeat buyers; Adidas held flat.\nA customer counts as churned after 90 days\nwith no new order. First-time buyers were up,\nso part of the rise is mix, not retention.\"",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1132917780,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "1. Raw analyst report (NOT stored)\n\n\"Churn rose from 31% to 38% in March.\nNike lost 1,240 repeat buyers; Adidas held flat.\nA customer counts as churned after 90 days\nwith no new order. First-time buyers were up,\nso part of the rise is mix, not retention.\"",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1794916799971,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 174649118,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
