      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "3. golden_trios: one row (column: value)\n\ntrio_id: churn-monthly\nversion: 1\nquestion: Why did customer churn rise last month?\nparaphrases:\n  - why are we losing customers\n  - are fewer customers coming back to buy again\n  - what is driving the increase in churn\nsql: WITH customer_days AS (...) ... > @churn_window_days ...\nmethod_summary: Define churn per order day ... compare the latest\n  closed month with the one before ... split by category and\n  traffic source ... check first-time-buyer mix before concluding\nparameters: [{name: churn_window_days, value: 90, unit: days}]\nscope_all: true  (-> Executives only)\nbrands: {}\ntables_used: {order_items}\nquestion_type: churn\nstatus: active\nsource_uri: seed/trios/churn-monthly.yaml\napproved_by: seed\nsearch: tsvector(question + method_summary)",
