      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "5. Eli (Executive) asks: \"why do customers stop buying?\"\n\nembed question -> [0.025, -0.101, ...]\ncosine vs ord 0 = 0.79\ncosine vs ord 1 = 0.88  <- best\ncosine vs ord 2 = 0.84\ncosine vs ord 3 = 0.81\nchurn-monthly score = 0.88 >= 0.75 -> sent to the agent\nDana (Nike Manager): never scored, filtered out by scope_all",
